sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Producer Application
  participant DB as Producer DbContext
  participant O as Module Outbox
  participant D as Worker Dispatcher
  participant T as Transport
  participant A as Holdings Adapter
  participant I as Holdings Inbox
  participant H as Holdings Application
  P->>DB: mutate business state
  P->>O: freeze Envelope and payload
  DB->>DB: commit business plus Outbox
  D->>O: short claim transaction and lease
  O-->>D: immutable logical message
  D->>T: send outside transaction
  T->>A: scoped delivery
  A->>A: validate producer schema tenant
  A->>H: isolated context and internal command
  H->>I: dedupe and complete
  H->>DB: commit projection plus Inbox
  A-->>T: success or duplicate ack
  T-->>D: success
  D->>O: conditional Delivered update
